<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index unchanged at 1,281.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index unchanged at 1,281.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates was unchanged today from 1,281 on May 14, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
